<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch postpone retail sales data until Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Dutch postpone retail sales data until Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics said Dutch April retail sales data, originally scheduled for Monday, would now be published on Tuesday.</p>
<p>An amended diary of key Dutch econonomic indicators due this week follows:</p>
<p>GMT---date---indicator---------------period---previous</p>
<p>    0730   3/6   retail sales		April    +2.8 pct yr/yr</p>
<p>    0730   5/6   foreign trade balance   Feb	+3.7 bln NLG</p>
<p>    0830   6/6   consumer price index    May	+1.8 pct yr/yr</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
